      "timestamp_iso": "2020-11-15T15:33:37+00:00",
      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1605454417000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Nov 15, 2020 10:33:37 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "<div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">Update 2020</span></div><br/><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;\">This clone never again attained the very dark throat coloring of the post four years ago.<br/>This could be caused by a number of growing condition issues, including age of plant. <br/>It is, however, a fantastic example of flava ornata. It's quite vigorous and easy to grow!<br/><br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2j7XM3i\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49961896017_77d1e1476c_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/><br/><br/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/2j7aMbN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/49952921358_62f9e614d0_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"/></a></span></div>",
      "body_text": "Update 2020\nThis clone never again attained the very dark throat coloring of the post four years ago.\nThis could be caused by a number of growing condition issues, including age of plant.\nIt is, however, a fantastic example of flava ornata. It's quite vigorous and easy to grow!",
